'''Bento Special''' (和定食, ''Wateishoku'', '''Japanese Set Meal''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
Starting Money UP (M): Wallet starts with 500¢.

